OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer cleared of
OL,4,Amisconduct after being filmed punching
OL,5,Aman
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police officer who was filmed
OL,8,Frepeatedly punching a man during an
OL,9,Farrest has been cleared of misconduct.
OL,11,FPC Richard Williams held Steven Clark
OL,12,Fin a headlock before punching him nine
OL,13,Ftimes to the head during an incident in
OL,14,FPorthmadog, Gwynedd, in May 2023.
OL,16,FFollowing a week-long hearing a
OL,17,Fmisconduct panel found PC Richard
OL,18,FWilliams acted with reasonable force,
OL,19,Fand accepted Clark had been potentially
OL,20,Fviolent, resisted arrest, and had been
OL,21,F"off his head" on drugs.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
